WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.738
The headline numbers are simple to remember.

00:00:02.818 --> 00:00:09.077
RetoMaton saves up to eighty-three percent of
nearest-neighbor searches with no loss in perplexity,

00:00:09.157 --> 00:00:15.545
or alternatively lowers perplexity by as much as
one point eight five when the search budget is kept.

00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:20.668
On WikiText-103 it matches kNN-LM while skipping
eighty-one percent of searches.

00:00:20.748 --> 00:00:27.840
And on a fine-tuned law-domain model it pushes
perplexity from eight point six one down to seven point one zero,

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:31.170
a relative reduction of more than seventeen percent.
